# Add patterns of files dvc should ignore, which could improve
# the performance. Learn more at
# https://dvc.org/doc/user-guide/dvcignore

# Without this, a dependency directory's dvc.lock hash (e.g. features_fraud's dependency on
# src/bankml/features/fraud) churns purely from bytecode-cache presence/absence between runs —
# found by re-running `dvc repro` twice with no source change and getting two different hashes.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
